{
  "title": "devsecops-platform — API SLO",
  "uid": "devsecops-api-slo",
  "tags": ["devsecops-platform", "slo"],
  "timezone": "",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request rate (5m)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(api_requests_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jobs pending",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "max(api_jobs_pending)", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 25 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 100 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jobs done (cumulative)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "max(api_jobs_done)", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drain throughput (5m)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(api_jobs_done[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "jobs/s" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate over time",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(api_requests_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Queue depth and drain rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(api_jobs_pending)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "pending"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(api_jobs_done[1m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "drain rate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Availability SLI — instrumentation pending",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Availability is not measured yet\n\nThe API currently exports `api_requests_total` as an aggregate counter without HTTP status labels. Request volume and queue health are visible above, but a successful-request ratio, 99% availability compliance, and error-budget burn rate cannot be calculated from these metrics.\n\n**The 99% SLO is a target, not an observed result.** Add response-status instrumentation before enabling an availability SLI or burn-rate alert. The current queue-backlog alert is an operational warning, not an SLO alert."
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] }
}
